@startuml LineFollowerAICurrentDrivingSequence
title Sequence: observation and motor action

participant "Zumo\nRadonUlzer RemoteControl" as RU
participant "ESP32\nDroidControlShip LineFollowerAI" as DCS

note over RU, DCS
Precondition: SMP is synchronized and driving is active.
The sensor transmission interval does not wait for a motor action.
end note

RU ->> DCS : Observation n
RU -> RU : Next sensor transmission interval runs
activate DCS
DCS -> DCS : Compute action n from observation n
DCS ->> RU : Motor setpoint n
deactivate DCS

alt [transmission interval ends before setpoint n is applied]
    RU ->> DCS : Observation n+1
    RU -> RU ++ : Apply setpoint n in the next control cycle
    deactivate RU
else [else]
    RU -> RU ++ : Apply setpoint n in the next control cycle
    deactivate RU
    RU ->> DCS : Observation n+1
end

note over RU, DCS
There is no acknowledgment when setpoint n is applied.
Observations n and n+1 may have identical values.
end note

@enduml
